<title>DENMARK: Danish Lauritzen posts lower 1996 loss.</title>
<headline>Danish Lauritzen posts lower 1996 loss.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>12-months to December 31 1996</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Net result		    259 loss vs 832 loss</p>
<p> Group pre-tax/extra.items result  421 loss vs 299 loss</p>
<p> Group net turnover		 14,358	vs 16,096</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (percent)	unchanged nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish shipping and shipbuilding group is J.Lauritzen Holding A/S. It said in a statement that it expected &quot;considerable advances&quot; in 1997. The result was slightly better than Lauritzen's own expectations of a 1996 full year net loss of around 300 million crowns.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-969652</p>
